message: "If you use AgentProof in research or evaluation, cite the repository and the exact commit."
title: "AgentProof: Evidence-Based Verification for Autonomous AI Agents"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hou
    given-names: Shengteng
repository-code: "https://github.com/shengtenghou4-star/8"
url: "https://shengtenghou4-star.github.io/8/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-07-19
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - verification
  - reproducibility
  - model route attestation
  - evidence integrity
abstract: >-
  AgentProof is an open-source framework that maps autonomous-agent claims to
  observable execution evidence, verifies model routes and artifacts, detects
  covered false-completion and evaluation-gaming behavior, replays declared
  checks, and emits machine-readable audit reports.
